    "text": "The program below always produces a valid schedule. It does not try to maximise the score beyond a simple greedy. It never moves services or creates binaries, and only uses `impl` and `wait` tasks.\n\n**Why the output is always valid:**\n- Each (feature, binary) pair is implemented at most once, and only in binaries that actually contain one of the feature's services.\n- With no moves, none of the move-locking rules can be broken.\n- Engineers that start on the same day are always assigned in increasing index order. Their tasks therefore appear in the submission in the same order the grader uses to compute C_B.\n- Every task starts before the time limit and lasts at least one day, so no engineer has more than L tasks.\n- Gaps before a task are filled with `wait`, and engineers with no tasks are left out of the output.\n\n**How the greedy works:** it simulates the days 0 \u2026 L\u20111 one at a time.\n1. Engineers who are free that day first take the remaining tasks of features already in progress, oldest feature first. If a task can no longer finish before L, that feature is abandoned.\n2. Remaining free engineers start new features. These are ranked by the estimated value per engineer\u2011day: U \u00d7 (L \u2212 estimated finish) / total work.\n3. A new feature is started only if every task that can begin immediately would finish before the time limit.\n\n**One assumption that only affects score:** a task ending on day t is assumed not to count toward C_B for tasks starting on day t. If the grader counts it, some durations are one day longer, which may lower the score but cannot make the output invalid.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main(){\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);cin.tie(nullptr);\n    int L,G,S,B,F,N;\n    if(!(cin>>L>>G>>S>>B>>F>>N))return 0;\n    unordered_map<string,int> sid; sid.reserve(S*2+10);\n    vector<int> binOf(S);\n    vector<long long> R(B,0);\n    for(int i=0;i<S;i++){string nm;int b;cin>>nm>>b;sid[nm]=i;binOf[i]=b;R[b]++;}\n    vector<string> fname(F);\n    vector<long long> D(F),U(F),W(F),MX(F);\n    vector<vector<int>> bins(F);\n    for(int i=0;i<F;i++){\n        int m;cin>>fname[i]>>m>>D[i]>>U[i];\n        vector<int> bs;bs.reserve(m);\n        for(int j=0;j<m;j++){string s;cin>>s;bs.push_back(binOf[sid[s]]);}\n        sort(bs.begin(),bs.end());bs.erase(unique(bs.begin(),bs.end()),bs.end());\n        bins[i]=bs;\n        long long w=0,mx=0;\n        for(int b:bs){long long d=D[i]+R[b];w+=d;mx=max(mx,d);}\n        W[i]=w;MX[i]=mx;\n    }\n    vector<long long> busy(B,0);\n    vector<vector<pair<int,int>>> ends(L+1);\n    set<int> freeE; for(int e=0;e<G;e++)freeE.insert(e);\n    vector<int> freeAt(G,0);\n    vector<vector<array<int,2>>> tasks(G);\n    vector<int> state(F,0); // 0 unstarted,1 active,2 done,3 abandoned\n    vector<int> nextIdx(F,0);\n    vector<int> active;\n    auto assign=[&](int e,int f,int b,int t,int dur){\n        if(freeAt[e]<t) tasks[e].push_back({-1,t-freeAt[e]});\n        tasks[e].push_back({f,b});\n        busy[b]++;\n        ends[t+dur].push_back({e,b});\n        freeAt[e]=t+dur;\n    };\n    int unstartedCount=F;\n    for(int t=0;t<L;t++){\n        for(auto&pr:ends[t]){busy[pr.second]--;freeE.insert(pr.first);}\n        if(freeE.empty())continue;\n        // active features\n        vector<int> na;\n        for(int f:active){\n            if(state[f]!=1)continue;\n            while(!freeE.empty()&&nextIdx[f]<(int)bins[f].size()){\n                int b=bins[f][nextIdx[f]];\n                long long dur=D[f]+R[b]+busy[b];\n                if(t+dur>=L){state[f]=3;break;}\n                int e=*freeE.begin();freeE.erase(freeE.begin());\n                assign(e,f,b,t,(int)dur);\n                nextIdx[f]++;\n            }\n            if(state[f]==1){\n                if(nextIdx[f]>=(int)bins[f].size())state[f]=2;\n                else na.push_back(f);\n            }\n        }\n        active.swap(na);\n        if(freeE.empty()||unstartedCount==0)continue;\n        long long m0=freeE.size();\n        vector<pair<double,int>> cand;\n        for(int f=0;f<F;f++){\n            if(state[f]!=0)continue;\n            long long k=bins[f].size();\n            long long m=min(k,m0);\n            long long est=t+max(MX[f],(W[f]+m-1)/m);\n            if(est>=L)continue;\n            double v=(double)U[f]*(double)(L-est)/(double)W[f];\n            cand.push_back({-v,f});\n        }\n        sort(cand.begin(),cand.end());\n        for(auto&c:cand){\n            if(freeE.empty())break;\n            int f=c.second;\n            long long k=bins[f].size();\n            long long m=min(k,(long long)freeE.size());\n            long long est=t+max(MX[f],(W[f]+m-1)/m);\n            if(est>=L)continue;\n            // precise check for immediately assignable tasks\n            long long cnt=min(k,(long long)freeE.size());\n            bool ok=true;\n            {\n                // simulate busy increments (bins distinct so each busy +0 from this feature)\n                for(long long i=0;i<cnt;i++){\n                    int b=bins[f][i];\n                    if(t+D[f]+R[b]+busy[b]>=L){ok=false;break;}\n                }\n            }\n            if(!ok)continue;\n            state[f]=1;unstartedCount--;\n            for(long long i=0;i<cnt;i++){\n                int b=bins[f][i];\n                long long dur=D[f]+R[b]+busy[b];\n                int e=*freeE.begin();freeE.erase(freeE.begin());\n                assign(e,f,b,t,(int)dur);\n            }\n            nextIdx[f]=(int)cnt;\n            if(nextIdx[f]>=(int)k)state[f]=2;\n            else active.push_back(f);\n        }\n    }\n    // output\n    string out;\n    int E=0;\n    for(int e=0;e<G;e++)if(!tasks[e].empty())E++;\n    out+=to_string(E)+\"\\n\";\n    for(int e=0;e<G;e++){\n        if(tasks[e].empty())continue;\n        out+=to_string(tasks[e].size())+\"\\n\";\n        for(auto&tk:tasks[e]){\n            if(tk[0]<0){out+=\"wait \"+to_string(tk[1])+\"\\n\";}\n            else{out+=\"impl \"+fname[tk[0]]+\" \"+to_string(tk[1])+\"\\n\";}\n        }\n    }\n    fwrite(out.data(),1,out.size(),stdout);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
